    <bpmn:process id="W_W4426" name="W4426. Lease Data Governance, Master &amp; Contract Repository" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Repository setup; new/amended lease; data-quality review
Frequency: Continuous + periodic data-quality audit
Volume: ~205+ lease records + amendments across 5 entities
Owner: Lease Accounting / Master Data (VS-29) / Controller
Participants: Master Data (VS-29), Lease Admin (VS-42), Legal (VS-100), Real Estate (VS-97), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W4426 — Lease Data Governance, Master &amp; Contract Repository</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4426_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4426_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4426_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4426_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4426_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4426_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4426_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4426_Start3" name="Repository setup; new/amended lease; data-quality review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4426_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4426_Task4" name="lease repository">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/Master Data maintain the lease repository — canonical lease record (abstract W4411, source contract, entity, asset class, dates, payments, options, status) linked to contract-management (VS-100/VS-42) and master data (VS-29)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Master Data
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4426_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4426_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4426_Task5" name="Lease Accounting run data-quality checks — completeness, duplicate detection…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Accounting run data-quality checks — completeness, duplicate detection, abstract-vs-contract match, key-field validation — and remediate exceptions
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4426_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4426_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4426_Task6" name="Lease Accounting/Legal retain contracts &amp; audit trail (VS-88), manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting/Legal retain contracts &amp; audit trail (VS-88), manage legal-hold (VS-100), and govern access per SoD (VS-29/W4428)
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Legal / IT
Accountable (A): Controller / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4426_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4426_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4426_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4426_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-111 (ensure PFRS 16 lease-accounting completeness.) | - CTL-676: canonical repository maintained; data-quality checked; abstract-vs-contract validated; records retained (VS-88); SoD-governed access
Owner: Lease Accounting / Master Data (VS-29) / Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4426_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4426_Annotation8" targetRef="W4426_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4426_Flow10" sourceRef="W4426_Start3" targetRef="W4426_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4426_Flow11" sourceRef="W4426_Task4" targetRef="W4426_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4426_Flow12" sourceRef="W4426_Task5" targetRef="W4426_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4426_Flow13" sourceRef="W4426_Task6" targetRef="W4426_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
