    <bpmn:process id="W_W4428" name="W4428. Audit, Internal Control &amp; SOX-Style Compliance for Leases" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Audit cycle; control review; SOX-style scoping
Frequency: Periodic audit + annual control review
Volume: Lease-accounting control set + audit cycle
Owner: Internal Audit (VS-21) / Lease Accounting / Controller
Participants: Audit (VS-21), Controller, Lease Accounting, Compliance (VS-22), External Auditor, Governance (VS-36)
Source: workflow W4428 — Audit, Internal Control &amp; SOX-Style Compliance for Leases</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4428_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4428_Lane1" name="Lease Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4428_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4428_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4428_Lane2" name="Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4428_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4428_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4428_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4428_Start4" name="Audit cycle; control review; SOX-style scoping">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4428_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4428_Task5" name="Lease Accounting/Audit design the lease-accounting internal-control set —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/Audit design the lease-accounting internal-control set — identification (W4410), abstracting review (W4411), rate/term/payment review (W4412), classification (W4413), recognition (W4414), modification (W4418), close/disclosure (W4425), SoD, access
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Audit
Accountable (A): Controller / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4428_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4428_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4428_Task6" name="Audit test key controls (SoD, dual review, reconciliation, disclosure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Audit test key controls (SoD, dual review, reconciliation, disclosure completeness), sample-test transactions, and assess SOX-style design &amp; operating effectiveness
Responsible (R): Audit / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Audit Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4428_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4428_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4428_Task7" name="Audit/Controller remediate findings, support external-audit (VS-21), and report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit/Controller remediate findings, support external-audit (VS-21), and report to Audit Committee/Governance (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Audit / Controller / Governance
Accountable (A): Audit Committee / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4428_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4428_End8" name="Complete">
