      <bpmn:userTask id="W4429_Task5" name="Tax/Lease Accounting determine the tax treatment per lease — VAT (12%) on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Tax/Lease Accounting determine the tax treatment per lease — VAT (12%) on residential/commercial rent as applicable, Expanded Withholding Tax (EWT) on rent, Documentary Stamp Tax (DST) on the lease contract, percentage tax considerations
Responsible (R): Tax / Lease Accounting
Accountable (A): Tax Lead / Controller
Duration: Per lease + on change</bpmn:documentation>
