Responsible (R): Lease Admin / AP / Tax
Accountable (A): Tax Lead
Duration: Per payment/contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4429_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4429_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
