        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Admin/Intercompany process rent/lease payments to third-party landlords (AP VS-15) and intercompany lease charges between the 5 entities (Property Mgmt as lessor, Depot as lessee) per arm&#x27;s-length transfer pricing
Responsible (R): Lease Admin / Intercompany
Accountable (A): Controller / Treasurer
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4430_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4430_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
