Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / Property Mgr / Consolidation
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4430_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
