Owner: Lease Accounting / BI (VS-28) / Finance (VS-17.4) / Real Estate (VS-97)
Participants: BI (VS-28), Finance (VS-17.4), Real Estate (VS-97), Lease Accounting, Strategy (VS-33), Controller
Source: workflow W4431 — Lease Portfolio Analytics, Total Cost of Occupancy &amp; Benchmarking</bpmn:documentation>
