        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lease Accounting/BI build lease analytics — ROU/liability balances, depreciation/interest expense, total-lease cash outflow, cost per sqm, cost-as-%-of-revenue, by entity/site/category
Responsible (R): Lease Accounting / BI / Finance
