        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Real Estate/Finance calculate total cost of occupancy (rent + CAM + utilities + property tax + maintenance) per site, benchmark vs retail/home-improvement norms, and identify outliers
Responsible (R): Real Estate / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4431_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4431_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4431_Task8" name="Strategy/Finance feed analytics into strategy (VS-33), site decisions…">
