    <bpmn:process id="W_W4432" name="W4432. Lease vs Buy, Renewal &amp; Optimization Decision Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Lease expiry; new asset need; capex decision; optimization review
Frequency: Per decision (~10–15 store + multiple equipment decisions/yr)
Volume: Renewal/new-lease/buy decisions across portfolio
Owner: Finance (VS-17.4) / Real Estate (VS-97) / Lease Accounting
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Treasury (VS-18), Capex (VS-40), Strategy (VS-33), Lease Accounting, Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4432 — Lease vs Buy, Renewal &amp; Optimization Decision Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4432_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4432_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4432_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4432_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4432_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4432_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4432_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4432_Start3" name="Lease expiry; new asset need; capex decision; optimization review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4432_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4432_Task4" name="lease-vs-buy">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/Real Estate build the lease-vs-buy analysis — compare PFRS 16 ROU/liability + total-lease-cost vs purchase capex + depreciation + financing + residual, with tax/cash-flow modeling
Responsible (R): Finance / Real Estate / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4432_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4432_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4432_Task5" name="Finance/Real Estate assess renewal vs relocate vs downsize at expiry — market…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Real Estate assess renewal vs relocate vs downsize at expiry — market rent, renewal terms, strategic fit, total occupancy (W4431), and negotiate (VS-42)
Responsible (R): Finance / Real Estate / Lease Admin
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Per expiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4432_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4432_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4432_Task6" name="Finance/Strategy execute optimization — consolidate sites, renegotiate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Strategy execute optimization — consolidate sites, renegotiate outliers, right-size space, convert to own (VS-97) where economic — and measure benefit realization (VS-112)
Responsible (R): Finance / Strategy / Real Estate
Accountable (A): CFO / Strategy Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4432_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4432_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4432_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4432_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-111 (ensure PFRS 16 lease-accounting completeness.) | - CTL-676: structured lease-vs-buy/renewal analysis; market-rent benchmarked; optimization measured; approved by Finance/Strategy
Owner: Finance (VS-17.4) / Real Estate (VS-97) / Lease Accounting</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
